        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of pulmonary artery aneurysms and venous thrombosis with exclusion of other vasculitides",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical and radiological; often considered a variant or incomplete form of Behçet disease."
